---

tests/data/saved_v10.tdts

  Written by this crate, and the reference for what a saved TDTS sheet looks
  like. Its key set, key order, indent and line endings were checked against
  a sheet the 東映 digital timesheet itself saved, key for key and byte for
  byte; the sheet itself is not here and none of its contents are — the
  columns, the cell numbers and the timing in this file are invented.

---

tests/data/csp_v5.xdts

  Written by this crate, and the reference for what a sheet exported by
  CLIP STUDIO PAINT EX looks like. Its key order, indent and line endings
  were checked against such a sheet, byte for byte; the sheet itself was
  production work and is not here, and none of its contents are — the cut
  number, the column names, the cell numbers and the timing in this file
  are invented.

---

tests/data/synthetic.tnz

  Written by hand for this crate, in the shape OpenToonz saves a scene —
  TOStream's tokens, its unescaped `&`, its references by id — as read off
  OpenToonz's source (toonz/sources/common/tstream/tstream.cpp and the
  column, level and xsheet savers in toonz/sources/toonzlib). The scene is
  invented: no level, path or timing in it comes from any production scene
  or from OpenToonz's sample scenes, which are CC BY-NC 4.0 and are not here.
